      "Html": "\u003Cstyle class=\u0022code-analysis-syntax\u0022\u003E\n.docs-content pre{overflow-x:auto;margin:1rem 0 1.75rem;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;border:1px solid rgba(20,42,72,.16);border-left:4px solid #0e6fae;border-radius:4px;background:#f7fbfe;color:#10263a}\n.docs-content pre code{white-space:pre;color:inherit;background:transparent;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}\n.language-csharp .syntax-comment{color:#587287;font-style:italic}.language-csharp .syntax-string{color:#8a3d12}.language-csharp .syntax-keyword{color:#6542a6;font-weight:700}.language-csharp .syntax-number{color:#096b65}.language-csharp .syntax-type{color:#0a6680;font-weight:600}\n\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003EA service must declare its validations in a Validations partial.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhat the Standard says\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0026ldquo;Validation\u0026rdquo; \u0026mdash; Validation is a foundation-service responsibility and is kept in a dedicated partial implementation. Separating it from the main operation makes validation rules explicit without mixing them into the service flow. \u003Ca href=\u0022https://github.com/hassanhabib/The-Standard/blob/master/2.%20Services/2.1%20Foundations/2.1%20Foundations.md#2131-validation\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003Eread it here\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhy it matters\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESeparating validation into a partial keeps protective logic beside the service without allowing it to obscure the business operation. The boundary makes validation easy to locate, review, and extend while the main file continues to express the service\u0027s essential flow.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EBad code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Violates STX0008: A service must declare its validations in a Validations partial.\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// StudentService.cs\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E partial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentBroker\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker)\n    : \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;(operation: \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E () =\u0026gt;\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent);\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInsertStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent: newStudent);\n\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E newStudent;\n        });\n\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eprivate\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estatic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent)\n    {\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidationRulesEngine\u003C/span\u003E.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidate\u003C/span\u003E(inputs: newStudent);\n\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ECompletedTask\u003C/span\u003E;\n    }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EGood code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Follows STX0008\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// StudentService.cs\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E partial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentBroker\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker)\n    : \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt;(operation: \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E () =\u0026gt;\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent);\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInsertStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent: newStudent);\n\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E newStudent;\n        });\n}\n\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// StudentService.Validations.cs\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Einternal\u003C/span\u003E partial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eprivate\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estatic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent)\n    {\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidationRulesEngine\u003C/span\u003E.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidate\u003C/span\u003E(inputs: newStudent);\n\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ECompletedTask\u003C/span\u003E;\n    }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E"
    }
